 status={**prev,'phase':58,'status':'complete_native_terrain_loading_validated;unknown_gameplay_purposes_remain_open','previous_goal_turn_classification':'progress:phase57moodsemantics;phase58fullTerrainloadingandchecksum/count/IDeffectsvalidatedwithoutinventingunknownnames','schema':'terrain-catalogue-validation.json','validation':'phase58-validation.json','findings':['Unknown198/224 all bits survive complete native loading;presence0 retains prior bytes,1/2/FFFFFFFF replace them','548-byte short record zero-fills missing224 then marks present','DirectID slot getter masksDWORD toBYTE and performs no count/slotID check','Duplicate ID overwrites slot but adds another normal record count/checksum contribution;update leaves counters and water/lava selectors unchanged','Native checksum collision pair verifies that equal sums do not attest equal definitions','32native cases/288lookup/11PEfunctions;82files3306records6612patches;67components;4EXEs unchanged'],'next_action':'Continue actual gameplay consumer search,prefer Objects34C/Traps204 or older-version typed producers. Terrain198/224 purposes remain open;complete loading/constructor/count/getter paths now validated,do not repeat these32cases without changes or new concern. Adjusted leads are unclassified and must be checked for structure identity before any semantic claim. Other AP04/08/CreatureSpell replacement questions remain open.','scope':'ExactDX fullTerrainparser/init/converter/callback/loader/getter and constructor with bounded memory-read and sound-handle fixtures,nullgraphicsprovider,preallocated256slots. No renderer or livegame. Existing67component package extended rather than inflated.','supplement':'terrain-lighting-semantics.json.phase58_complete_loading'}
